{"id":"21c138585934c017","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/091_代数化逻辑_Algebraizable_Logic.md","title":"091 代数化逻辑 Algebraizable Logic","display":"091_代数化逻辑_Algebraizable_Logic","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>修订状态：repair-candidate。原审查评级仅针对备份的原始字节；本稿为授权修复候选。</p>\n</blockquote>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-公式代数型\">1. 公式代数型</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega=(Op,ar)\">\\(\\Omega=(Op,ar)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ar:Op\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(ar:Op\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>。公式变元集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Var=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(Var=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>。公式集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Fm_\\Omega\">\\(Fm_\\Omega\\)</span> 是满足下列闭包条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in Var\">\\(p\\in Var\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"var(p)\\in Fm_\\Omega\">\\(var(p)\\in Fm_\\Omega\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in Op\">\\(c\\in Op\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ar(c)=n\">\\(ar(c)=n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha:n\\to Fm_\\Omega\">\\(\\alpha:n\\to Fm_\\Omega\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"app(c,\\alpha)\\in Fm_\\Omega\">\\(app(c,\\alpha)\\in Fm_\\Omega\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>变元出现函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"PV:Fm_\\Omega\\to\\mathcal P(Var)\">\\(PV:Fm_\\Omega\\to\\mathcal P(Var)\\)</span> 满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"PV(var(p))=\\{p\\},\n\\qquad\nPV(app(c,\\alpha))=\\bigcup_{i&lt;ar(c)}PV(\\alpha(i)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[PV(var(p))=\\{p\\},\n\\qquad\nPV(app(c,\\alpha))=\\bigcup_{i&lt;ar(c)}PV(\\alpha(i)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公式替换集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Sub_\\Omega=\\{\\sigma:Var\\to Fm_\\Omega\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Sub_\\Omega=\\{\\sigma:Var\\to Fm_\\Omega\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in Sub_\\Omega\">\\(\\sigma\\in Sub_\\Omega\\)</span>，其扩张满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(var(p))=\\sigma(p)\">\\(\\widehat\\sigma(var(p))=\\sigma(p)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(app(c,\\alpha))=app(c,i\\mapsto\\widehat\\sigma(\\alpha(i)))\">\\(\\widehat\\sigma(app(c,\\alpha))=app(c,i\\mapsto\\widehat\\sigma(\\alpha(i)))\\)</span>。无绑定构造子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价为字面相等。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-句法后承系统\">2. 句法后承系统</h1>\n<p>后承参数是关系</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_L\\subseteq\\mathcal P(Fm_\\Omega)\\times Fm_\\Omega.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\vdash_L\\subseteq\\mathcal P(Fm_\\Omega)\\times Fm_\\Omega.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>它被要求满足四条本地结构条件；以下统一量化 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,\\Delta\\subseteq Fm_\\Omega\">\\(\\Gamma,\\Delta\\subseteq Fm_\\Omega\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in Fm_\\Omega\">\\(A\\in Fm_\\Omega\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in Sub_\\Omega\">\\(\\sigma\\in Sub_\\Omega\\)</span>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>自反：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_L A\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash_L A\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>单调：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_L A\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash_L A\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\Delta\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\Delta\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\\vdash_L A\">\\(\\Delta\\vdash_L A\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>替换不变：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_L A\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash_L A\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma[\\Gamma]\\vdash_L\\widehat\\sigma(A)\">\\(\\widehat\\sigma[\\Gamma]\\vdash_L\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>传递：若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\\vdash_L A\">\\(\\Delta\\vdash_L A\\)</span> 且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\Delta\">\\(B\\in\\Delta\\)</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_L B\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash_L B\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_L A\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash_L A\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>闭包算子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Cn_L(\\Gamma)=\\{A\\in Fm_\\Omega:\\Gamma\\vdash_L A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Cn_L(\\Gamma)=\\{A\\in Fm_\\Omega:\\Gamma\\vdash_L A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"3.-方程语言\">3. 方程语言</h1>\n<p>方程集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Eq_\\Omega=\\{eq(A,B):A,B\\in Fm_\\Omega\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Eq_\\Omega=\\{eq(A,B):A,B\\in Fm_\\Omega\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>方程替换满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"eq(A,B)\\widehat\\sigma=eq(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[eq(A,B)\\widehat\\sigma=eq(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>方程集替换像定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma[E]=\\{e\\widehat\\sigma:e\\in E\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma[E]=\\{e\\widehat\\sigma:e\\in E\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-代数与方程满足\">4. 代数与方程满足</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\">\\(\\Omega\\)</span>-代数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=(|A|,(c^A)_{c\\in Op})\">\\(A=(|A|,(c^A)_{c\\in Op})\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(|A|\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c^A:|A|^{ar(c)}\\to |A|\">\\(c^A:|A|^{ar(c)}\\to |A|\\)</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Alg_\\Omega\">\\(Alg_\\Omega\\)</span> 为所有此类集合载体代数的元语言类谓词缩写。赋值集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Val(A)=\\{\\nu:Var\\to |A|\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Val(A)=\\{\\nu:Var\\to |A|\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对每个固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in Alg_\\Omega\">\\(A\\in Alg_\\Omega\\)</span>，公式值函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"⟦-⟧_A:Fm_\\Omega\\times Val(A)\\to|A|\">\\(⟦-⟧_A:Fm_\\Omega\\times Val(A)\\to|A|\\)</span> 按构造高度递归满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦ var(p)⟧_A^\\nu=\\nu(p),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦ var(p)⟧_A^\\nu=\\nu(p),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦ app(c,\\alpha)⟧_A^\\nu\n=\nc^A(i\\mapsto⟦\\alpha(i)⟧_A^\\nu).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦ app(c,\\alpha)⟧_A^\\nu\n=\nc^A(i\\mapsto⟦\\alpha(i)⟧_A^\\nu).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>方程满足为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A,\\nu\\models_E eq(B,C)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n⟦ B⟧_A^\\nu=⟦ C⟧_A^\\nu.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A,\\nu\\models_E eq(B,C)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n⟦ B⟧_A^\\nu=⟦ C⟧_A^\\nu.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-等式后承\">5. 等式后承</h1>\n<p>代数类参数为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\\subseteq Alg_\\Omega.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal K\\subseteq Alg_\\Omega.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"E\\models_{\\mathcal K}^{eq} e\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[E\\models_{\\mathcal K}^{eq} e\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq Eq_\\Omega,e\\in Eq_\\Omega\">\\(E\\subseteq Eq_\\Omega,e\\in Eq_\\Omega\\)</span>，当且仅当</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall A\\in\\mathcal K\\ \\forall\\nu\\in Val(A)\\,\n[(\\forall d\\in E\\ A,\\nu\\models_E d)\\Rightarrow A,\\nu\\models_E e].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall A\\in\\mathcal K\\ \\forall\\nu\\in Val(A)\\,\n[(\\forall d\\in E\\ A,\\nu\\models_E d)\\Rightarrow A,\\nu\\models_E e].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\">\\(\\mathcal K\\)</span> 是固定的代数类谓词参数，类量化按其给定谓词展开；不把所有代数的类或任意代数类放进集合元组。下文证书在每个固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\">\\(\\mathcal K\\)</span> 下由集合载体构成，全部相关检查使用这个实际参数。</p>\n<h1 id=\"6.-翻译函数\">6. 翻译函数</h1>\n<p>代数化数据由两个有限翻译给出：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\tau:Fm_\\Omega\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Eq_\\Omega),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\tau:Fm_\\Omega\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Eq_\\Omega),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta:Fm_\\Omega\\times Fm_\\Omega\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Fm_\\Omega).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta:Fm_\\Omega\\times Fm_\\Omega\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Fm_\\Omega).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>替换相容谓词分别定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubCompat}_{\\tau}(\\tau)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\sigma\\in Sub_\\Omega\\,\\forall A\\in Fm_\\Omega\\quad\n\\tau(\\widehat\\sigma(A))=\\widehat\\sigma[\\tau(A)],\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubCompat}_{\\tau}(\\tau)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\sigma\\in Sub_\\Omega\\,\\forall A\\in Fm_\\Omega\\quad\n\\tau(\\widehat\\sigma(A))=\\widehat\\sigma[\\tau(A)],\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubCompat}_{\\Delta}(\\Delta)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\sigma\\in Sub_\\Omega\\,\\forall A,B\\in Fm_\\Omega\\quad\n\\Delta(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B))\n=\n\\widehat\\sigma[\\Delta(A,B)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubCompat}_{\\Delta}(\\Delta)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\sigma\\in Sub_\\Omega\\,\\forall A,B\\in Fm_\\Omega\\quad\n\\Delta(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B))\n=\n\\widehat\\sigma[\\Delta(A,B)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公式集与方程集翻译提升 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau^*:\\mathcal P(Fm_\\Omega)\\to\\mathcal P(Eq_\\Omega)\">\\(\\tau^*:\\mathcal P(Fm_\\Omega)\\to\\mathcal P(Eq_\\Omega)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta^*:\\mathcal P(Eq_\\Omega)\\to\\mathcal P(Fm_\\Omega)\">\\(\\Delta^*:\\mathcal P(Eq_\\Omega)\\to\\mathcal P(Fm_\\Omega)\\)</span> 分别定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\tau^{*}(\\Gamma)\n=\n\\bigcup_{B\\in\\Gamma}\\tau(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\tau^{*}(\\Gamma)\n=\n\\bigcup_{B\\in\\Gamma}\\tau(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta^{*}(E)\n=\n\\bigcup_{eq(C,D)\\in E}\\Delta(C,D).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta^{*}(E)\n=\n\\bigcup_{eq(C,D)\\in E}\\Delta(C,D).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-代数化四条件\">7. 代数化四条件</h1>\n<p>先定义实际复合翻译</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FComp_{\\tau,\\Delta}:Fm_\\Omega\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Fm_\\Omega),\\qquad\nFComp_{\\tau,\\Delta}(A)=\\Delta^*(\\tau(A)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FComp_{\\tau,\\Delta}:Fm_\\Omega\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Fm_\\Omega),\\qquad\nFComp_{\\tau,\\Delta}(A)=\\Delta^*(\\tau(A)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"EComp_{\\tau,\\Delta}:Fm_\\Omega^2\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Eq_\\Omega),\\qquad\nEComp_{\\tau,\\Delta}(A,B)=\\tau^*(\\Delta(A,B)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[EComp_{\\tau,\\Delta}:Fm_\\Omega^2\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Eq_\\Omega),\\qquad\nEComp_{\\tau,\\Delta}(A,B)=\\tau^*(\\Delta(A,B)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>下文固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau,\\Delta\">\\(\\tau,\\Delta\\)</span> 后，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"FComp(A),EComp(A,B)\">\\(FComp(A),EComp(A,B)\\)</span> 分别缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"FComp_{\\tau,\\Delta}(A),EComp_{\\tau,\\Delta}(A,B)\">\\(FComp_{\\tau,\\Delta}(A),EComp_{\\tau,\\Delta}(A,B)\\)</span>。有限值由有限集的有限并保证；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau^*,\\Delta^*\">\\(\\tau^*,\\Delta^*\\)</span> 仍允许任意输入集。定义四条件为完整量化的闭合谓词：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alg}_1(\\vdash_L,\\tau,\\mathcal K)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal P(Fm_\\Omega)\\ \\forall A\\in Fm_\\Omega\\,\n[\\Gamma\\vdash_L A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall e\\in\\tau(A)\\ \\tau^*(\\Gamma)\\models_{\\mathcal K}^{eq}e],\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Alg}_1(\\vdash_L,\\tau,\\mathcal K)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal P(Fm_\\Omega)\\ \\forall A\\in Fm_\\Omega\\,\n[\\Gamma\\vdash_L A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall e\\in\\tau(A)\\ \\tau^*(\\Gamma)\\models_{\\mathcal K}^{eq}e],\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alg}_2(\\vdash_L,\\Delta,\\mathcal K)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall E\\in\\mathcal P(Eq_\\Omega)\\ \\forall A,B\\in Fm_\\Omega\\,\n[E\\models_{\\mathcal K}^{eq}eq(A,B)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\delta\\in\\Delta(A,B)\\ \\Delta^*(E)\\vdash_L\\delta],\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Alg}_2(\\vdash_L,\\Delta,\\mathcal K)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall E\\in\\mathcal P(Eq_\\Omega)\\ \\forall A,B\\in Fm_\\Omega\\,\n[E\\models_{\\mathcal K}^{eq}eq(A,B)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\delta\\in\\Delta(A,B)\\ \\Delta^*(E)\\vdash_L\\delta],\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alg}_3(\\vdash_L,\\tau,\\Delta)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall A\\in Fm_\\Omega\\,\n[(\\forall\\delta\\in FComp_{\\tau,\\Delta}(A)\\ \\{A\\}\\vdash_L\\delta)\n\\land FComp_{\\tau,\\Delta}(A)\\vdash_L A],\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Alg}_3(\\vdash_L,\\tau,\\Delta)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall A\\in Fm_\\Omega\\,\n[(\\forall\\delta\\in FComp_{\\tau,\\Delta}(A)\\ \\{A\\}\\vdash_L\\delta)\n\\land FComp_{\\tau,\\Delta}(A)\\vdash_L A],\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alg}_4(\\tau,\\Delta,\\mathcal K)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall A,B\\in Fm_\\Omega\\,\n[(\\forall e\\in EComp_{\\tau,\\Delta}(A,B)\\ \\{eq(A,B)\\}\\models_{\\mathcal K}^{eq}e)\n\\land EComp_{\\tau,\\Delta}(A,B)\\models_{\\mathcal K}^{eq}eq(A,B)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Alg}_4(\\tau,\\Delta,\\mathcal K)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall A,B\\in Fm_\\Omega\\,\n[(\\forall e\\in EComp_{\\tau,\\Delta}(A,B)\\ \\{eq(A,B)\\}\\models_{\\mathcal K}^{eq}e)\n\\land EComp_{\\tau,\\Delta}(A,B)\\models_{\\mathcal K}^{eq}eq(A,B)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Alg_3\">\\(Alg_3\\)</span> 核验公式经两次翻译后与原公式互相可导；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Alg_4\">\\(Alg_4\\)</span> 核验方程经两次翻译后与原方程互相等式后承。空翻译值同样执行反向义务：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"FComp(A)=\\varnothing\">\\(FComp(A)=\\varnothing\\)</span> 时要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\\vdash_L A\">\\(\\varnothing\\vdash_L A\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"EComp(A,B)=\\varnothing\">\\(EComp(A,B)=\\varnothing\\)</span> 时要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\\models_{\\mathcal K}^{eq}eq(A,B)\">\\(\\varnothing\\models_{\\mathcal K}^{eq}eq(A,B)\\)</span>，不会因空目标族而跳过恢复。</p>\n<p>双向复合条款依照 <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/html/2210.06047v3#S3.SS1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Nakov–Quadrellaro, Definition 3.2, (A3)–(A4)</a> 校准。本稿保留给定代数类及任意前提集；引用用于翻译和恢复条件，文献的有限后承、拟簇范围没有加入本地参数要求。</p>\n<h1 id=\"8.-实际证书与六项检查\">8. 实际证书与六项检查</h1>\n<p>标签集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{CheckLabel}=\\{s_\\tau,s_\\Delta,a_1,a_2,a_3,a_4\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{CheckLabel}=\\{s_\\tau,s_\\Delta,a_1,a_2,a_3,a_4\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\">\\(\\mathcal K\\)</span>，集合载体证书是三元组</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cert}_{Alg}^{\\mathcal K}\n=\\{(\\tau,\\Delta,\\mathcal P):\n\\tau:Fm_\\Omega\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Eq_\\Omega),\\quad\n\\Delta:Fm_\\Omega^2\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Fm_\\Omega),\\quad\n\\mathcal P\\subseteq\\mathsf{CheckLabel}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Cert}_{Alg}^{\\mathcal K}\n=\\{(\\tau,\\Delta,\\mathcal P):\n\\tau:Fm_\\Omega\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Eq_\\Omega),\\quad\n\\Delta:Fm_\\Omega^2\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Fm_\\Omega),\\quad\n\\mathcal P\\subseteq\\mathsf{CheckLabel}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>代数类是环境参数，不作为集合三元组的坐标。固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_L,\\mathcal K\">\\(\\vdash_L,\\mathcal K\\)</span> 后，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Pass_{L,\\mathcal K}\">\\(Pass_{L,\\mathcal K}\\)</span> 的域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cert}_{Alg}^{\\mathcal K}\\times\\mathsf{CheckLabel}\">\\(\\mathsf{Cert}_{Alg}^{\\mathcal K}\\times\\mathsf{CheckLabel}\\)</span>。对实际记录 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=(\\tau,\\Delta,\\mathcal P)\">\\(C=(\\tau,\\Delta,\\mathcal P)\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>标签 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell\">\\(\\ell\\)</span></th>\n<th><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Pass_{L,\\mathcal K}(C,\\ell)\">\\(Pass_{L,\\mathcal K}(C,\\ell)\\)</span> 当且仅当</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_\\tau\">\\(s_\\tau\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"SubCompat_\\tau(\\tau)\">\\(SubCompat_\\tau(\\tau)\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_\\Delta\">\\(s_\\Delta\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"SubCompat_\\Delta(\\Delta)\">\\(SubCompat_\\Delta(\\Delta)\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_1\">\\(a_1\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Alg_1(\\vdash_L,\\tau,\\mathcal K)\">\\(Alg_1(\\vdash_L,\\tau,\\mathcal K)\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_2\">\\(a_2\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Alg_2(\\vdash_L,\\Delta,\\mathcal K)\">\\(Alg_2(\\vdash_L,\\Delta,\\mathcal K)\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_3\">\\(a_3\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Alg_3(\\vdash_L,\\tau,\\Delta)\">\\(Alg_3(\\vdash_L,\\tau,\\Delta)\\)</span>，同时检查实际 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta^*(\\tau(A))\">\\(\\Delta^*(\\tau(A))\\)</span> 两方向</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_4\">\\(a_4\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Alg_4(\\tau,\\Delta,\\mathcal K)\">\\(Alg_4(\\tau,\\Delta,\\mathcal K)\\)</span>，同时检查实际 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau^*(\\Delta(A,B))\">\\(\\tau^*(\\Delta(A,B))\\)</span> 两方向</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>合格谓词为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"GoodAlg_{L,\\mathcal K}(C)\\Longleftrightarrow\nC=(\\tau,\\Delta,\\mathcal P)\\in\\mathsf{Cert}_{Alg}^{\\mathcal K}\n\\land\\mathcal P=\\mathsf{CheckLabel}\n\\land\\forall\\ell\\in\\mathsf{CheckLabel}\\ Pass_{L,\\mathcal K}(C,\\ell).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[GoodAlg_{L,\\mathcal K}(C)\\Longleftrightarrow\nC=(\\tau,\\Delta,\\mathcal P)\\in\\mathsf{Cert}_{Alg}^{\\mathcal K}\n\\land\\mathcal P=\\mathsf{CheckLabel}\n\\land\\forall\\ell\\in\\mathsf{CheckLabel}\\ Pass_{L,\\mathcal K}(C,\\ell).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>标签齐全只是其中一项条件；仍逐项检查实际记录的翻译函数及当前类参数，不允许从登记标签推断全称义务已成立。这是语义/后承性质的验收记录，未声称六个标签给出可机械判定的有限证明。</p>\n<h1 id=\"9.-代数化判断\">9. 代数化判断</h1>\n<p>在第 2、5、6 节的合法参数域上，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Algz(\\vdash_L,\\tau,\\Delta,\\mathcal K)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathcal P\\subseteq\\mathsf{CheckLabel}\\ GoodAlg_{L,\\mathcal K}((\\tau,\\Delta,\\mathcal P)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Algz(\\vdash_L,\\tau,\\Delta,\\mathcal K)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathcal P\\subseteq\\mathsf{CheckLabel}\\ GoodAlg_{L,\\mathcal K}((\\tau,\\Delta,\\mathcal P)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><strong>全称正例</strong>：实例化 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Op=\\{t,n,a,o\\}\">\\(Op=\\{t,n,a,o\\}\\)</span>、元数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,1,2,2\">\\(0,1,2,2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=app(t,())\">\\(T=app(t,())\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A=app(n,(A))\">\\(\\neg A=app(n,(A))\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\land B=app(a,(A,B))\">\\(A\\land B=app(a,(A,B))\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\lor B=app(o,(A,B))\">\\(A\\lor B=app(o,(A,B))\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B=(\\neg A)\\lor B\">\\(A\\to B=(\\neg A)\\lor B\\)</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_2\">\\(B_2\\)</span> 的载体为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t^{B_2}()=1\">\\(t^{B_2}()=1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n^{B_2}(d)=1-d\">\\(n^{B_2}(d)=1-d\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a^{B_2}(d,e)=\\min(d,e)\">\\(a^{B_2}(d,e)=\\min(d,e)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"o^{B_2}(d,e)=\\max(d,e)\">\\(o^{B_2}(d,e)=\\max(d,e)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_L\">\\(\\vdash_L\\)</span> 为所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v:Var\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(v:Var\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 的指定真值后承，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K=\\{B_2\\}\">\\(\\mathcal K=\\{B_2\\}\\)</span> 是该固定代数的单元素类。令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\leftrightarrow B\">\\(A\\leftrightarrow B\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A)\">\\((A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A)\\)</span> 的公式代数项缩写，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\tau(A)=\\{eq(A,T)\\},\\qquad\\Delta(A,B)=\\{A\\leftrightarrow B\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\tau(A)=\\{eq(A,T)\\},\\qquad\\Delta(A,B)=\\{A\\leftrightarrow B\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>两翻译逐构造与替换相容。对任意赋值，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"eq(A,T)\">\\(eq(A,T)\\)</span> 成立恰当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 取真值；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\leftrightarrow B\">\\(A\\leftrightarrow B\\)</span> 取真值恰当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span> 值相同，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Alg_1,Alg_2\">\\(Alg_1,Alg_2\\)</span> 对任意前提集成立。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"FComp(A)=\\{A\\leftrightarrow T\\}\">\\(FComp(A)=\\{A\\leftrightarrow T\\}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 在每个赋值下同值；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"EComp(A,B)=\\{eq(A\\leftrightarrow B,T)\\}\">\\(EComp(A,B)=\\{eq(A\\leftrightarrow B,T)\\}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"eq(A,B)\">\\(eq(A,B)\\)</span> 在每个赋值下同真，故两复合各自的两个方向均成立，六标签齐全的实际证书合格。这里仅给出本地布尔实例的全称论证，未把全部参数默认成布尔逻辑。</p>\n<p><strong>定向负例</strong>：在同一非退化布尔后承/代数类上，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau(A)=\\varnothing\">\\(\\tau(A)=\\varnothing\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta(A,B)=\\{A\\leftrightarrow B\\}\">\\(\\Delta(A,B)=\\{A\\leftrightarrow B\\}\\)</span>。原弱 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Alg_3\">\\(Alg_3\\)</span> 的对角 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\leftrightarrow A\">\\(A\\leftrightarrow A\\)</span> 及原弱 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Alg_4\">\\(Alg_4\\)</span> 的空目标族都真；新 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Alg_3\">\\(Alg_3\\)</span> 却要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\\vdash_L var(p)\">\\(\\varnothing\\vdash_L var(p)\\)</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v(p)=0\">\\(v(p)=0\\)</span> 即失败；新 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Alg_4\">\\(Alg_4\\)</span> 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\\models^{eq}_{\\mathcal K}eq(var(p),var(q))\">\\(\\varnothing\\models^{eq}_{\\mathcal K}eq(var(p),var(q))\\)</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v(p)=0,v(q)=1\">\\(v(p)=0,v(q)=1\\)</span> 即失败。此例单独检验恢复条件，未声称该坏翻译通过原其余标签。伪造全标签集合也不能使新 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"GoodAlg\">\\(GoodAlg\\)</span> 真。缺标签、错误翻译类型或未知标签在证书域/合格检查中拒绝。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-目标差异与最终检查接口\">10. 目标差异与最终检查接口</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Feature}_{Algz}(\\tau,\\Delta)=\n(\\tau,\\Delta,FComp_{\\tau,\\Delta},EComp_{\\tau,\\Delta},Alg_1,Alg_2,Alg_3,Alg_4,\n\\mathsf{Cert}_{Alg}^{\\mathcal K},Pass_{L,\\mathcal K},GoodAlg_{L,\\mathcal K}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Feature}_{Algz}(\\tau,\\Delta)=\n(\\tau,\\Delta,FComp_{\\tau,\\Delta},EComp_{\\tau,\\Delta},Alg_1,Alg_2,Alg_3,Alg_4,\n\\mathsf{Cert}_{Alg}^{\\mathcal K},Pass_{L,\\mathcal K},GoodAlg_{L,\\mathcal K}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>这里 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_L,\\mathcal K\">\\(\\vdash_L,\\mathcal K\\)</span> 为已经固定的实际环境。目标差异谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_{Algz}(\\vdash_L,\\tau,\\Delta,\\mathcal K)\">\\(\\Delta_{Algz}(\\vdash_L,\\tau,\\Delta,\\mathcal K)\\)</span> 为参数满足第 2、5、6 节的类型/结构要求，特征数据等于上述已定义元组，且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Algz(\\vdash_L,\\tau,\\Delta,\\mathcal K)\\Longleftrightarrow\nSubCompat_\\tau(\\tau)\\land SubCompat_\\Delta(\\Delta)\n\\land Alg_1(\\vdash_L,\\tau,\\mathcal K)\\land Alg_2(\\vdash_L,\\Delta,\\mathcal K)\n\\land Alg_3(\\vdash_L,\\tau,\\Delta)\\land Alg_4(\\tau,\\Delta,\\mathcal K).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Algz(\\vdash_L,\\tau,\\Delta,\\mathcal K)\\Longleftrightarrow\nSubCompat_\\tau(\\tau)\\land SubCompat_\\Delta(\\Delta)\n\\land Alg_1(\\vdash_L,\\tau,\\mathcal K)\\land Alg_2(\\vdash_L,\\Delta,\\mathcal K)\n\\land Alg_3(\\vdash_L,\\tau,\\Delta)\\land Alg_4(\\tau,\\Delta,\\mathcal K).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该等价由六标签的定义保证；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_3\">\\(a_3\\)</span> 及所有调用点均包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_4\">\\(a_4\\)</span> 及所有调用点均包含反向等式恢复。记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cert}_{Alg},Pass,GoodAlg\">\\(\\mathsf{Cert}_{Alg},Pass,GoodAlg\\)</span> 为固定环境下上述参数族的缩写，最终元组按这些本地环境参数读取。</p>\n<h1 id=\"11.-整个形式系统\">11. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>最终形式系统为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{AlgebraizableLogic}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\Omega,\nVar,\nFm_\\Omega,\nPV,\nSub_\\Omega,\n\\widehat\\sigma,\n\\vdash_L,\nCn_L,\nEq_\\Omega,\nAlg_\\Omega,\nVal,\n⟦-⟧,\n\\models_E,\n\\mathcal K,\n\\models_{\\mathcal K}^{eq},\n\\tau,\n\\Delta,\n\\tau^{*},\n\\Delta^{*},\nFComp_{\\tau,\\Delta},\nEComp_{\\tau,\\Delta},\n\\operatorname{SubCompat}_{\\tau},\n\\operatorname{SubCompat}_{\\Delta},\n\\operatorname{Alg}_{1},\n\\operatorname{Alg}_{2},\n\\operatorname{Alg}_{3},\n\\operatorname{Alg}_{4},\n\\mathsf{CheckLabel},\n\\mathsf{Cert}_{Alg},\n\\operatorname{Pass},\n\\operatorname{GoodAlg},\n\\operatorname{Algz},\n\\mathsf{Feature}_{Algz},\n\\Delta_{Algz}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{AlgebraizableLogic}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\Omega,\nVar,\nFm_\\Omega,\nPV,\nSub_\\Omega,\n\\widehat\\sigma,\n\\vdash_L,\nCn_L,\nEq_\\Omega,\nAlg_\\Omega,\nVal,\n⟦-⟧,\n\\models_E,\n\\mathcal K,\n\\models_{\\mathcal K}^{eq},\n\\tau,\n\\Delta,\n\\tau^{*},\n\\Delta^{*},\nFComp_{\\tau,\\Delta},\nEComp_{\\tau,\\Delta},\n\\operatorname{SubCompat}_{\\tau},\n\\operatorname{SubCompat}_{\\Delta},\n\\operatorname{Alg}_{1},\n\\operatorname{Alg}_{2},\n\\operatorname{Alg}_{3},\n\\operatorname{Alg}_{4},\n\\mathsf{CheckLabel},\n\\mathsf{Cert}_{Alg},\n\\operatorname{Pass},\n\\operatorname{GoodAlg},\n\\operatorname{Algz},\n\\mathsf{Feature}_{Algz},\n\\Delta_{Algz}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统含公式代数、固定代数上的赋值递归、句法与方程后承、双向复合恢复、有限翻译和固定环境下六项实际检查的代数化证书；不含 Hilbert 证明序列、Kripke 框架或某个固定的具体矩阵逻辑。</p>\n<p>最终系统元组登记固定环境、集合对象及本地参数族；类谓词项是元语言登记，不把含类谓词的整个登记宣称为 ZFC 集合。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-公式代数型","text":"1. 公式代数型","level":1},{"id":"2.-句法后承系统","text":"2. 句法后承系统","level":1},{"id":"3.-方程语言","text":"3. 方程语言","level":1},{"id":"4.-代数与方程满足","text":"4. 代数与方程满足","level":1},{"id":"5.-等式后承","text":"5. 等式后承","level":1},{"id":"6.-翻译函数","text":"6. 翻译函数","level":1},{"id":"7.-代数化四条件","text":"7. 代数化四条件","level":1},{"id":"8.-实际证书与六项检查","text":"8. 实际证书与六项检查","level":1},{"id":"9.-代数化判断","text":"9. 代数化判断","level":1},{"id":"10.-目标差异与最终检查接口","text":"10. 目标差异与最终检查接口","level":1},{"id":"11.-整个形式系统","text":"11. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Omega=(Op,ar)","display":false},{"tex":"ar:Op\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"Var=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"Fm_\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in Var","display":false},{"tex":"var(p)\\in Fm_\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"c\\in Op","display":false},{"tex":"ar(c)=n","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha:n\\to Fm_\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"app(c,\\alpha)\\in Fm_\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"PV:Fm_\\Omega\\to\\mathcal P(Var)","display":false},{"tex":"PV(var(p))=\\{p\\},\n\\qquad\nPV(app(c,\\alpha))=\\bigcup_{i<ar(c)}PV(\\alpha(i)).","display":true},{"tex":"Sub_\\Omega=\\{\\sigma:Var\\to Fm_\\Omega\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\sigma\\in Sub_\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat\\sigma(var(p))=\\sigma(p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat\\sigma(app(c,\\alpha))=app(c,i\\mapsto\\widehat\\sigma(\\alpha(i)))","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash_L\\subseteq\\mathcal P(Fm_\\Omega)\\times Fm_\\Omega.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Gamma,\\Delta\\subseteq Fm_\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in Fm_\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma\\in Sub_\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash_L A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash_L A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta\\vdash_L A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash_L A","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat\\sigma[\\Gamma]\\vdash_L\\widehat\\sigma(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta\\vdash_L A","display":false},{"tex":"B\\in\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash_L B","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash_L A","display":false},{"tex":"Cn_L(\\Gamma)=\\{A\\in Fm_\\Omega:\\Gamma\\vdash_L A\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"Eq_\\Omega=\\{eq(A,B):A,B\\in F